  "answer": "I couldn't find a past ticket reporting this problem. The archived Shortcut Guide tickets cover other issues: the Ctrl keypress sent when releasing the Win key, app-specific guides, the overlay staying open after a lock, and the overlay popping up on its own. None of them is about the foreground module/exe being logged only on the first invocation instead of on every trigger. Treat this as a new bug. The fix is to move the foreground-capture logging (LogForegroundCapture in Program.cs) so it runs on every overlay trigger, not just once at startup. That way each trigger leaves a log record to help diagnose cases where an application's shortcuts are not shown correctly."
